desc: Make four copies of this line
category: manual
par: 4
hint1: Yank once, then paste with a count
hint2: yy yanks the line; p pastes it — a count pastes multiple copies
solution: yy3p
note: yy yanks the line; 3p pastes it three times below, making four copies total.
--- START ---
duplicate me
--- GOAL ---
duplicate me
duplicate me
duplicate me
duplicate me
--- END ---
